    <code code="10154-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Chief complaint Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Chief Complaint</title>
    <text><paragraph>Next-day review after drainage and extraction of the abscessed molar by oral and maxillofacial surgery this morning. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
