<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Ms. Hatshepsut returns the day after her first visit. This morning Dr. Lindqvist-Bello of oral and maxillofacial surgery examined her, took a panoramic radiograph, drained the abscess and extracted the broken lower left molar under local anesthesia. The throbbing has eased since the drainage, and the swelling has not spread. She has had no fever, trouble opening her mouth, or trouble swallowing. She took ibuprofen and acetaminophen overnight as advised. She took her first metformin tablet with last night&apos;s meal without stomach upset. She has not checked her glucose at home. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Procedure today</td><td>Panoramic radiograph; incision and drainage; extraction of tooth 19</td></tr><tr><td>Symptoms</td><td>Throbbing eased; swelling not spreading; no fever, trismus or difficulty swallowing</td></tr><tr><td>Medicines</td><td>Ibuprofen with acetaminophen; metformin 500 mg started last night; no antibiotic</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

