    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever or chills</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Sore at the extraction site; swelling settling; no difficulty swallowing or opening the mouth</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No nausea or diarrhea on metformin</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Positive</td><td>Waking once at night to pass urine</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

